parent_comment_text:
Aise kitane bank account open karenge? 
Ye tau bank se fraud hua hai, iska harjana bank ko dena padega, aur jo employees ne kiya unko direct faansi deni chahiye aur unaki saari property seize karani chahiye, unake gharwale sadak par bhik mangate najar aane chahiye; 
Mai agar iss desh ka prime minuster ban gaya tau mai aisa ki strict kanoon banaunga.

